# The Dinner Roll: Thanksgiving's Human kind, as the Walk-on is
# Halloween's. A round roll, all golden crust with two score marks on top
# and a pale rim underneath, eyes and a smile in the crust, stubby arms in white
# gloves, orange legs and black cleats, and the team's gold striped helmet.
